constructed
route: GET /pods/<pod>
status: 200
tack-sends: yes
built-from: pod-attended.json with the two keys of a team paused on its budget (`paused`, `pausedReason: budget`) and the one key a docket that lists `podResume` adds to a team's report: `budget` (tokens, used, window, windowStart)
docket: not shipped; the key Tack asked of docket's session on 2026-11-03 (ADR 0036 "What is asked of docket"), API 6, additive, announced in `features` as `podResume`
date: 2026-11-04
note: not captured, because no docket sends this key yet; the key is the one Tack asked for and nothing else, and the values are made up. Tack reads it only when `GET /health` lists `podResume`. It replaces this file with a capture the day docket ships the feature.
